Project: Wuffs (Wrangling Untrusted File Formats Safely)
URL: https://github.com/google/wuffs
Version: release/c/wuffs-v0.4.c, "0.4.0-alpha.12+4048.20261020" (main at b36a81d3)
License: MIT OR Apache-2.0 (see LICENSE); BUI uses it under MIT, which is
         compatible with BUI's GPL-2.0-or-later.
Used for: PNG, GIF (animated), BMP, TGA and QOI decoding in kit/intern/image
          (format_wuffs.c). Wuffs is memory-safe by construction (bounds and
          overflow checks are proven at compile time) and the fastest of the
          decoders measured for these formats (see website bench page).

Unmodified. Only the modules BUI configures in format_wuffs.c are compiled.
